bass  | F#2- F#2 F#2 F#2- F#2 F#2 F#2- F#2 F#2 F#2- F#3- | G2- G2 G2 G2- G2 G2 G2- G2 G2 G2- G3- | F#2- F#2 F#2 F#2- F#2 F#2 F#2- F#2 F#2 F#2- F#3- | C#2- C#2 C#2 C#2- C#2 C#2 C#2- C#2 C#2 C#2- C#3- |
stab  | [F#m]!--- .------- [F#m]!--- | [G]!--- .----------- | [F#m]!--- .------- [F#m]!--- | [C#]!--- [C#]!--- [C#7]!------- |
hit   | [F#m]!--- .----------- | [G]!--- .----------- | [F#m]!--- .----------- | [C#]!--- .------- [C#7]!--- |
